     accessible to third parties.
  2. Any commercial use, including paid access, subscriptions,
     advertising, or bundling into paid products.
  3. Use of the WayBack name, the wayback.pro domain, or the site design
     for your own service.
  4. Removing or replacing the watermark in generated video files.

Requests: open an issue at github.com/demigreeen/wayback.

USER-GENERATED VIDEO
Videos a user creates from their own data belong to that user. The WayBack
copyright holder claims no rights to them and never receives them:
the files never leave the browser.

